Can't do it.

The vo'a-series and the go'a-series refer to the places >of the selbri
as a whole<, independent of how that place structure was acquired.
The place structure of a tanru is normally that of its rightmost brivla.
(The exception is that places preceding a "co"-based selbri are specially
treated, and may belong to a different brivla).  The tertanru, i.e.
modificand, is not specially privileged.

